<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY SEPT CENTRAL BANK RESERVES $10.4 BLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY SEPT CENTRAL BANK RESERVES $10.4 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary's</p>
<p>reserves stood at $10.4 billion at end-September, up from $9.74</p>
<p>billion at end-August, the bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
